OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew specialised policing to crack
OL,4,Adown on crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpecialised police patrols are to be
OL,7,Fdeployed in Surrey for the first time.
OL,9,FKnown as Project Servator, highly
OL,10,Fvisible uniformed officers with police
OL,11,Fdogs, along with harder-to-spot plain
OL,12,Fclothes operatives, will be popping up
OL,13,Fat various times around Guildford town
OL,14,Fcentre to deter criminals and reassure
OL,15,Fthe public.
OL,17,FA tactic already adopted by other UK
OL,18,Fpolice forces, its has resulted in
OL,19,Fnumerous arrests and helped remove
OL,20,Fillegal firearms, knives and drugs from
OL,21,Fthe streets.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
