OL,3,GNEWSANew specialised policing to crack
OL,4,Adown on crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Supt Graham Barnett said it was
OL,7,F"about keeping people safe and ensuring
OL,8,FSurrey remains a hostile environment
OL,9,Ffor those looking to commit crime".
